libvips and bundled image libraries
-----------------------------------
The web standalone runtime contains @img/sharp-libvips-linuxmusl-x64 1.3.4,
including libvips 8.18.7 and its bundled native dependencies. The upstream
package README lists these components and their licenses; LGPL-covered
components include fribidi, glib, libexif, libheif, librsvg, libvips, pango,
and proxy-libintl. See the notices for the pinned package version:
https://github.com/lovell/sharp-libvips/blob/v1.3.4/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md

The libvips package declares LGPL-3.0-or-later. Its upstream README describes
